      "text": "men of Sodom were wicked and sinners, Gen. 13:13. sinners against their own souls, Num. 16:38. sinners shall be converted unto thee, Ps. 51:13. Let the sinners be consumed, Ps. 104:35. if sinners entice thee, consent thou not, Prov. 1:10. wickedness overthroweth the sinner, Prov. 13:6. Evil pursueth sinners, Prov. 13:21. wealth of the sinner is laid up for the just, Prov. 13:22. to the sinner he giveth travail, Eccl. 2:26. one sinner destroyeth much good, Eccl. 9:18. sinners in Zion are afraid, Isa. 33:14.",
