      "text": "publicans and sinners … sat down with him, Matt. 9:10 (Mark 2:15). I am not come to call the righteous, but sinners, Matt. 9:13 (Mark 2:17; Luke 5:32). Son of man is betrayed into the hands of sinners, Matt. 26:45 (Mark 14:41). sinners also love those that love them, Luke 6:32. This man receiveth sinners, Luke 15:2. joy … in heaven over one sinner that repenteth, Luke 15:7 (15:10). God be merciful to me a sinner, Luke 18:13. gone to be guest with a man that is a sinner, Luke 19:7. while we were yet sinners, Christ died for us, Rom. 5:8. Jesus came into the world to save sinners, 1 Tim. 1:15. high priest … undefiled, separate from sinners, Heb. 7:26. Cleanse your hands, ye sinners, James 4:8. converteth the sinner from the error of his way, James 5:20.",
